{
  "date": "2026-11-17",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "银联和Visa加强合作，让跨境付款更方便",
  "title_en": "UnionPay and Visa strengthen cooperation to make cross-border payments easier",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月16日，中国银联和Visa在深圳前海举办了一个活动，宣布两家公司要在三个方面加深合作。银联和Visa都是世界上有名的银行卡支付网络。",
      "en": "On November 16, China UnionPay and Visa held an event in Qianhai, Shenzhen, and announced that the two companies will deepen their cooperation in three areas. UnionPay and Visa are both well-known bank card payment networks around the world."
    },
    {
      "zh": "第一，两个支付网络会直接连在一起。这样，参加这次合作的数字钱包用户，可以用银联的付款方式，在全球支持银联或Visa非接触支付（不用插卡，碰一下就能付）的地方买东西。中国人去国外消费会更方便。",
      "en": "First, the two payment networks will be connected directly. This way, users of digital wallets taking part in this cooperation can use UnionPay as their payment method to buy things anywhere in the world that accepts UnionPay or Visa contactless payments (no need to insert a card — just tap to pay). It will be more convenient for Chinese people to spend money abroad."
    },
    {
      "zh": "第二，外国人来中国付款会更简单。他们可以用Nihao China App扫码买东西、坐公交和地铁、在餐厅吃饭，还可以办离境退税。商户不用换掉现在的银联收款机器，外国用户也不用开中国的银行账户或者办中国的手机号。Visa会第一个支持这项服务。",
      "en": "Second, paying in China will become simpler for foreigners. They can use the Nihao China App to scan codes to shop, take buses and the metro, eat in restaurants, and also get departure tax refunds. Merchants don't need to replace their current UnionPay payment machines, and foreign users don't need to open a Chinese bank account or get a Chinese phone number. Visa will be the first to support this service."
    },
    {
      "zh": "第三，两家公司会一起研究智能体支付。智能体是可以替人完成任务的AI程序。胡浩中是银联的执行副总裁，尹小龙是Visa中国区的总裁，他们两个人都表示，这次合作能让跨境支付更方便。",
      "en": "Third, the two companies will jointly study AI agent payments. An AI agent is an AI program that can complete tasks on a person's behalf. Hu Haozhong is UnionPay's executive vice president and Yin Xiaolong is the president of Visa's China region; both of them said this cooperation will make cross-border payments more convenient."
    }
  ],
